    description: "## What\nA read-only `@xyflow/react` (MIT, 12.12) graph view in packages/htrac-frontend rendering items as nodes and `isbefore` / parent relationships as edges, sourced from the live Y.Doc over the sync endpoint (item D), with awareness highlights (nodes other clients are currently viewing). This is the tracker's \"edgeless\" view -- the structured-graph half of what ADR-0019 originally imagined BlockSuite's edgeless mode doing -- and the natural view for the `isbefore` chains the trackerize playbook produces.\n## Scope\nRead-only. Layout: dagre/elk via xyflow examples or manual layering by priority; filter by tag/status; click a node to open its item. No editing of relationships from the graph (that stays CLI/op-only per the ADR).\n## Done when\nGraph renders the live tracker, updates within one sync round-trip of a CLI `update --add-isbefore`, and shows another client's awareness highlight. Typechecks and builds locally.\n## Context\n~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/notebookjournal_10162026_2318.md section 4."  # 03d3
    fields: {}  # 03d3
